    <location><![CDATA[/search [q parameter]]]></location>
    <severity>High</severity>
    <confidence>Firm</confidence>
    <issueBackground><![CDATA[Reflected cross-site scripting arises when data is copied from a request and echoed into the application's immediate response in an unsafe way.]]></issueBackground>
