    <severity>High</severity>
    <confidence>Firm</confidence>
    <issueBackground><![CDATA[Serialized objects in HTTP messages can lead to remote code execution when the application deserializes attacker-controlled data.]]></issueBackground>
    <issueDetail><![CDATA[A Java serialized object (magic bytes rO0AB) was observed in the state parameter. This pattern is associated with CWE-502 and with CVE-2017-9805 in affected stacks.]]></issueDetail>
